MLS L3 on 5x4 deg grids

0) login to NASA EarthData
Download Data. You will need to log in with a free NASA Earthdata Login Account to approve the download script or access the direct HTTPS links.
Note that T and O3 are complete but the WV line sensor not working well after 2023 so there may be WV data gaps

1) go to NASA Earthdata Search Portal.

2) search for ML3MBO3_005 (22 granules from 2004 to now)
  Found in https://search.earthdata.nasa.gov/search/granules?p=C2042568830-GES_DISC&q=ML3MBO3_005
  Click "Download all"
  It makes a script for you, see eg
  Goto /umbc/xfs3/strow/asl/mls/V005/ML3MBO3_005 and run it
    [sergio@chip-login2 ML3MBO3_005]$ ls -lt *.nc | wc -l
    22
   cp /umbc/xfs3/strow/asl/mls/V005/ML3MBO3_005/download_o3.sc download_o3.sc

